at%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32c9cfc7cc792954245f332594ba82f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c6d3c1a8/uploads/origins/cfea3528-c95f-4565-8462-2a45145912db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa87a8bd340a5526c43564119340d5a8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art! \nCan I have my character [Rareel] drawn in a style similar to this: https://twitter.com/non__stop/status/1484594519727165440/photo/1\n\n[Rareel] is a happy and playful child!\nPose and background is left to artist freedom! Please have fun, and thank you!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/5tdlv8z7uwv3rbc/Rareel%20Reference%202019%20-%20Crop.png?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@non__stop/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0097b0c5/uploads/origins/6a98ce2b-d248-4fe3-8a3f-4d1bae241012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51209643c23ddf6453cd9a8fcc9a13e1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0097b0c5/uploads/origins/6a98ce2b-d248-4fe3-8a3f-4d1bae241012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51209643c23ddf6453cd9a8fcc9a13e1, https://si.imgix.net/0097b0c5/uploads/origins/6a98ce2b-d248-4fe3-8a3f-4d1bae241012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e40f5fa40b17d00e48bf05fd93d09b5b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0097b0c5/uploads/origins/6a98ce2b-d248-4fe3-8a3f-4d1bae241012?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f06aa79cf2f36aef636017af828f416 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私はあなたのアートが好きで、私のキャラクターがあなたのアートスタイルで描かれるのを見たいと思っています。ポーズや衣装は自由に決めてください。もし、リンクされているヘッドフォンを入れていただければ、とても嬉しいです。ありがとうございました。\n\n参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FVR9IOOx08tDtkz8ZCKGKgwPas1ao8fX?usp=sharing\nhttps://imgur.com/a/UCWjIHY", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@non__stop/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net